lass="r-mdabge"><div data-rid="e55227a7-8d97-4ace-bad3-ee75fbbf21b5" class="r-7k9t0u"><div data-rid="5b6ca386-6e8e-49ad-b3b9-ecb444c33a8b" class="r-11chqux alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Why it works</span></div></div><div data-rid="95b573b7-092e-425a-b187-975e357f8267" class="r-uamk1j"><div data-rid="9caaa1ab-c3b6-4a79-a956-019b38762a4a" class="r-7a6azb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It looks like confidence before<br>anyone says a word.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="990d4e49-d657-42f8-aa2d-1171412f3392" class="r-1o4sw68"><div data-rid="f427c063-7c74-4949-850f-df1749114acb" class="r-mz7t1t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most pocket squares collapse, wrinkle, or disappear. This one stays sculptural, upright, and intentional all night.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="cf783e72-8866-41fb-805e-0faf99bfc410" class="r-10n4usi"><div data-rid="263e4822-2f1e-4ae7-8a8c-0d6e48ada592" class="r-14g99ko"></div><div data-rid="ed26955d-2b69-4a4b-bd86-a17746aa288a" class="r-qh43kh"><div data-rid="5731d245-ee29-4295-adef-1dce9c0a38c6" class="r-11i0iak"></div><div data-rid="3910145e-a2c4-454b-a221-6a11a3d4bb24" class="r-146grg1"></div></div></div><div data-rid="a03e839a-72b7-4e33-abfd-15e3c9d61a1a" tabindex="0" role="link" class="r-1on41mt"><div data-rid="fe99205b-6b37-4dc8-b0e2-09844457bdcf" class="r-1lzboyk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Build your Pocket Square</p></span></div><div data-rid="70b3c453-6758-498f-bf09-126cd4769d55" class="r-1nekjz1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b2722dad-8554-4b4c-892d-c3bdb5e257db" class="r-1polgxf"><div data-rid="276fdede-eb1d-4036-a988-c78786ce01cb" class="r-16mgd58"><div data-rid="2e45de02-cbbd-4bda-97e5-d0d9f55b9028" class="r-1qcbani"><div data-rid="fb8a62c8-042d-4260-bff8-b59607ff3e53" class="r-1c4f2l1"><div data-rid="4aa30c6b-750e-4f59-a0cd-fc4c96dc9159" class="r-1xgf58w alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">The product detail lab</span></div></div><div data-rid="3449d45e-948f-4889-84e0-ffcf7e4db9ac" class="r-1agky89"><div data-rid="5c658bc9-a0cb-445a-917d-f84168178920" class="r-1nbqke1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>This does what fabric cannot.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="817ca269-233e-49ca-9081-3abea9899986" class="r-3f6lho"><div data-rid="19c30968-593b-42cc-adb8-fb6f864a4bc3" class="r-1lli25q alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Fabric pocket squares fold, collapse, puff unevenly, and disappear into the pocket. The Pocket Square™ is sculpted like jewelry and secured with a magnetic insert, so it stays exactly where it belongs: upright, polished, and ready for every formal moment.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="ce7b32f9-2f07-4699-923f-80d7d6f1e728" class="r-1m6g9wk"><div data-rid="94b7fade-d677-40e6-98a7-2ee1806eacfc" class="r-1raa61d"><div data-rid="c0eb8232-ef63-4187-9972-b7470c69dbba" class="r-glzuvf"><div data-rid="6ea3f6ca-84b3-4be4-aac1-382aeec2733d" class="r-if6h0f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">01</span></div></div><div data-rid="1796e922-602f-44f2-b8f4-ab1e56e3473c" class="r-6cr9q2"><div data-rid="c0ebd1d7-2626-48df-be70-a20327eb7419" class="r-1bdrhg8"><div data-rid="84b03b83-fe99-44ac-a6d2-1f7c605870ee" class="r-1vww7lg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Stays upright</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="56618161-6100-4d64-af4a-030fcbb3f318" class="r-1dru8th"><div data-rid="f5ae7bc4-ba8a-4e27-b05e-9fdfac11081c" class="r-v6wfem alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No folding, pinning, puffing, or constant adjusting. The sculpted metal design keeps a clean, intentional silhouette.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="13dcf01d-b546-4db0-888d-249fd8e4c4d1" class="r-1kn0yu0"><div data-rid="2930c756-df06-4463-a41f-d73fa4e2143e" class="r-1q6i7hb"><div data-rid="95f04df7-6c9e-4d70-8c35-3060693932aa" class="r-112a4yj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">02</span></div></div><div data-rid="bede3f44-b331-4350-b10d-22583208c35d" class="r-1ociwwr"><div data-rid="6d1375d7-b50b-4755-81c3-364620f0e218" class="r-6gsvpz"><div data-rid="df13e744-944e-4d1d-92dd-1c32c3ca2914" class="r-1qfdy9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Secures with a patented insert</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="7dc91a80-7251-47e0-a93f-1dd5cbb82b05" class="r-194ajhy"><div data-rid="dc0979e0-61a2-4ecb-a960-4177f75766ba" class="r-1jsvgt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The magnetic insert keeps the design positioned in the pocket without folding, pinning, or adjusting.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c81ce489-7ece-44b7-bc9b-8352eda6b458" class="r-6t5cer"><div data-rid="a7f294ae-ea74-4bd5-bbab-754a6a93e18b" class="r-rdd65q"><div data-rid="aed699b8-bc7e-49e4-a39c-4f829c4dcf25" class="r-1rjokqn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">03</span></div></div><div data-rid="6d2d39b8-11d8-45c9-a0dc-ae654c39b3ac" class="r-1njd5nf"><div data-rid="3636d51c-17ab-4494-8b5f-9454340c255f" class="r-ph7yth"><div data-rid="9ce0134a-d406-4102-965d-24047b503c77" class="r-1ebobsk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Reads as real jewelry</span></div></div><div data-rid="752a7d26-9c75-472a-a41e-71b9532e002b" class="r-vpc0w5"><div data-rid="010018e6-6b94-4ba2-b738-f14f29f1db1f" class="r-uactwe alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>From weddings to black-tie events to red carpet moments, it gives the finish of real jewelry with the placement of a pocket square.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1459f1bb-1c10-429b-a71b-4110cc2056ab" class="r-16h8d15"><div data-rid="1c92a3d2-a3ac-4a72-b749-29fbf1fe0306" class="r-1kgk53p"><div data-rid="29916491-a695-45e9-b19c-8c8dbfc4db73" class="r-17b8lf1"><div class="r-1s0wzqp"><video src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/30bbbb90-a427-4024-b01f-01160b18f163/b4238d70-3cb5-4e45-9c04-cbc94f84dff5" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" autoplay="" muted="" loop=""></video></div><div da