a-rid="c9018cb0-dec0-4b15-97bb-e24fa4f3e10c" class="r-1r8b65z alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Build your Pocket Square</p></span></div><div data-rid="da7a6684-5fe4-4ce0-845a-12bc9473d094" class="r-1wz1oyw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="b61a456a-613f-4bb6-af3f-ad1b73681a1b" class="r-1twwau5"><div data-rid="30b5a02e-f7b6-431f-9a85-a4df28d4ee29" class="r-1cb99to"><div data-rid="0be4e817-a9d7-43ec-9521-dbe6ddebf6c3" class="r-1vjkr08"><div data-rid="6ca69ecc-50a1-4e32-96b1-83de13b263ad" class="r-n3gu2p"></div><div data-rid="2bd85bd7-ba39-4518-bb5e-ab7221918055" class="r-1lh0tgc"><div data-rid="2e156f94-5dff-4c13-9e18-459450d0ba26" class="r-rty2tu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">01 — Carved</span></div></div><div data-rid="8385e43f-f1ed-4b3f-a9bc-5f594d24f1eb" class="r-ch32kq"><div data-rid="aca980c7-66e2-47f2-a868-c2023941a7d0" class="r-1t4yri alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every design starts by hand. Jose carves each piece from solid jeweler’s wax—turning an idea into something you can hold.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="5a15e624-f560-4446-8625-701b6d9eab7b" class="r-19utbj3"><div data-rid="c1eac337-7f85-4d04-a231-d3d893d013f1" class="r-yls0ca"></div><div data-rid="e205d1e8-1884-44e6-b259-fd4940b0fb9e" class="r-nj4jhs"><div data-rid="0c5cc9f4-5acb-44fe-8569-c1d2f6c96c8a" class="r-1of1qqk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">02 — Molded</span></div></div><div data-rid="415b67e3-2873-453f-8854-b844abd09fd7" class="r-13nejsn"><div data-rid="96998c40-9d2e-44fa-b3a8-859b19ee6e0e" class="r-xfgfmh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Once the original is carved, a mold is created to preserve every detail.</p><p>That mold is used to form each piece in wax before it becomes metal.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="b9a34e5e-e40f-40e7-a1e7-b575f206e1bf" class="r-1eviy4c"><div data-rid="a89d6a93-d657-4686-8d67-b17243ab2f25" class="r-1q9tj0z"></div><div data-rid="47286a9f-5975-4b1b-b4d0-146c63695ec1" class="r-1va1l3y"><div data-rid="839b5f77-c5ac-49bb-af17-6355079941cd" class="r-xrkr9l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">03 — Cast</span></div></div><div data-rid="8a682503-1ab5-4241-8e8c-77100c4938b0" class="r-93smoa"><div data-rid="81c80be4-0bf6-46d7-8cdb-65a86a8582f3" class="r-5g2i9a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Using lost-wax casting, the wax is replaced with molten metal: sterling silver, bronze, or white bronze.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="79dea69f-adbc-4bca-b90f-17f6ab1a645e" class="r-lxhgqi"><div data-rid="9d3e58eb-5821-4351-bbbc-494be9762be5" class="r-1nvq4uk"></div><div data-rid="d6c36291-ecbe-43ff-8b67-07c24aa56f3a" class="r-1fhdfcm"><div data-rid="b4f14f73-cad9-4e6f-9f3b-cc12106a6c90" class="r-1tmmqj4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>04 — LOCALLY MADE</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="502dcd38-d586-455e-8675-3ce43b6c5107" class="r-yemalz"><div data-rid="45bdd6a7-985e-4159-b183-7085d2c9896b" class="r-1pglg3i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The piece is polished, refined, paired with the insert, inspected, and packed with care.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1bc30763-2ad2-4222-b5c8-ee699848bede" class="r-imudms"><div data-rid="5463c7fa-442e-4c48-a0dc-55579f2d95ce" class="r-jg4f9r"><div data-rid="88a001d8-553d-4655-8a77-0628560caf96" class="r-1p2ryu5"><picture data-rid="a774fa48-28c0-4520-b5f3-24ccdecbe662" class="r-1l284l0"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/0415/5989/files/The_Balli_Family._From_left_to_right_-_Lucas_Joshua_Lisa_Jose_Sarah_bfb6c081-b8cf-45ba-a611-0a926e91082e.jpg?v=1773979236&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/0415/5989/files/The_Balli_Family._From_left_to_right_-_Lucas_Joshua_Lisa_Jose_Sarah_bfb6c081-b8cf-45ba-a611-0a926e91082e.jpg?v=1773979236&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/0415/5989/files/The_Balli_Family._From_left_to_right_-_Lucas_Joshua_Lisa_Jose_Sarah_bfb6c081-b8cf-45ba-a611-0a926e91082e.jpg?v=1773979236&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/0415/5989/files/The_Balli_Family._From_left_to_right_-_Lucas_Joshua_Lisa_Jose_Sarah_bfb6c081-b8cf-45ba-a611-0a926e91082e.jpg?v=1773979236" class="r-173zrz5" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="89731df5-161a-41a4-bc07-c9ee35364dd0" class="r-1ketmyg"><div data-rid="995b7848-916f-41ed-bc4a-da0d2d0de3b9" class="r-5uk89"><div data-rid="5cce1891-1c73-476a-9ee9-bf4cb11cc783" class="r-1kv7fp4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>About Jose Balli</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="7439a356-1f83-43fe-bdc3-6e1d91a13210" class="r-1pe7e1p"><div data-rid="e0d5a78d-adc9-481a-bcd8-ec07a12f3be8" class="r-137d3qy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Family-run jewelry, made the hard way (because it's better).</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="d8382145-8158-48d1-b47c-7ae3b33b4793" class="r-1nthrkw"><div data-rid="26bb82a4-9288-4c29-aa96-85e6bf0d4e10" class="r-19u6w1s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Jose Balli Jewelry is a New Orleans family-owned small business built around original designs, superior quality, and in-house production. The Pocket Square™ collection is part jewelry, part menswear invention: sculptural, secure, and unmistakably different.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="883ea09f-1a42-4524-b8a2-6169e662c4af" class="r-1jav5wx"><div data-rid="f06efbde-5098-4eed-9971-d4eee519bf09" class="r-1vx12eu"><div data-rid="c8e54c64-7d21-4335-afb2-5f39cde49f7d" class="r-jxysi4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Family-owned</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="bb653d77-41a4-48c6-8249-31f46a993d9f" class="r-hrcjk5"><div data-rid="1da166b4-f49d-4492-b6b8-e02fe9fe0edb" class="r-1mq728e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Original designs</span></div></div><div data-rid="08e9c7eb-5